<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-11-17T05:09:33.978Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 05:09:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran launched a second drone attack on the U.S. base in Bahrain and struck a building in Tel Aviv, prompting U.S. strikes on Iran's Qeshm Island and the disabling of a commercial vessel in the Gulf of Oman. The regime also opened a women’s war-readiness training camp and labeled the Argentine navy and air force as terrorist organisations while warning European bases hosting U.S. forces of retaliation. In Yemen, Houthi forces advanced, forcing Saudi-backed forces to retreat from Aden and seize control of a key strait. A third U.S. aircraft carrier arrived in the Middle East, increasing the U.S. naval presence. 123 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/16/aircraft-middle-east-trump-military&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/15/world/middleeast/saudi-houthis-yemen-red-sea.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/17/tankers-hit-in-strait-of-hormuz-as-drone-raises-alarm-at-iraq-gas-field?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/16/world/middleeast/iran-dams-missile-sites-environmentalists.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/16/us-and-iran-slide-closer-to-fresh-all-out-war-as-new-exchange-of-fire-increases&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxNUVlLQzhTNkp4OVh5aWIwYllRRjRpOU9jM3FDQUM5eDc1eVhXVk9jai1ibFEzSTU0TzdjeFJLS05VdkpNZTVVN2EydGRQVldwcEQyeGNsXzZfcWQwRU5JdEFHai1sc2IxSWFxRk9WbzF3UDkzRHlVMzNkWVJIOFpmM2JqY01nR29tRVJlVFMwcUFwSXZUX0xNLWkydzk2WEdoZy13aXptUG9FZlEydVVhcHhOcW1hT3d6S0NUX3g2NXMta080U1VwVS1n?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt